<title>FRANCE: One ship loading flour in Rouen, two more due.</title>
<headline>One ship loading flour in Rouen, two more due.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>One ship was loading 11,000 tonnes of flour in Rouen destined for Libya, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Two more ships were expected in port by June 11 to load 19,000 tonnes of flour. The destination was not specified. --Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
